&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who is Seyond?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seyond™ is a global leader in high fidelity LiDAR solutions, powering the future of mobility across ADAS, ITS, Robotics, Stationary and Off-Road industries. Seyond delivers a dynamic portfolio of robust, high resolution LiDAR sensors, perception software, and the Seyond ITS Management Platform (SIMPL). Founded in Silicon Valley with a global footprint, Seyond is dedicated to the highest quality engineering and manufacturing, and unwavering commitment to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Seyond ITS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drawing on deep expertise in precision sensing and edge intelligence, Seyond offers a robust portfolio of LiDAR sensors, perception software, and transportation analytics solutions designed to improve roadway safety, traffic operations, and multimodal mobility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This portfolio includes the SIMPL™ ITS Management Platform, Seyond’s LiDAR-based detection solution for smart intersections and highways. SIMPL operates as a distinct business unit with dedicated pricing and go-to-market authority across two verticals: urban intersection management and interurban highway, tunnel, and tolling detection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Director, ITS, Europe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Remote, Europe&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team: &lt;/strong&gt;Seyond ITS — SIMPL, our LiDAR-based smart intersection and highway detection platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type: &lt;/strong&gt;Full-time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Seyond SIMPL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SIMPL is scaling its international footprint across Europe, APAC, and emerging markets, and is building out dedicated regional sales leadership to match the growth already underway in the Americas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Sales Director, ITS, Europe to build and lead SIMPL’s sales function across Europe — a role modeled on the regional sales leadership Seyond has already established in the Americas. You will sit above SIMPL’s country-level sales representatives across Europe, giving the region a single accountable sales leader for the first time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach role. We need someone who has personally carried and exceeded a sales quota — not a candidate whose background is purely sales operations or account management — and who can also recruit, coach, and manage a small, distributed team of regional reps as the European organization scales.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead SIMPL’s European sales organization, recruiting, onboarding, and coaching country and regional sales representatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personally own and close strategic opportunities while the regional team is being built out, transitioning toward a team-quota model as the organization scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute go-to-market strategy across both SIMPL verticals: urban intersection management and inter-urban highway/tunnel/tolling detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and grow relationships with European distributors, system integrators, and OEM partners, alongside direct engagement with end-user agencies and pilot customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the European sales pipeline and forecast in HubSpot, maintaining accurate deal ownership, stage progression, and close-date discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent SIMPL at European trade shows, industry events, and customer meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with SIMPL’s European engineering team on technical qualification and solution scoping for major opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Head of Global ITS Business and BU leadership on regional pricing, deal structuring, and strategic account planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear rep-level KPIs that balance new-business generation with existing-account growth, supported by weekly activity tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of B2B sales experience, ideally in ITS, smart infrastructure, industrial IoT/sensors, or another technical, tender-driven market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven personal quota-carrying track record as an individual contributor — a genuine “hunter,” not primarily an account manager or sales-ops leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or leading a distributed regional sales team, ideally spanning multiple European countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort managing both channel relationships (distributors, OEMs, system integrators) and direct end-user/agency sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating public-sector or government tender processes is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English required; German or another major European language is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel extensively across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An existing network in European traffic management, tolling, or highway agencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling LiDAR, radar, or other sensor-based detection technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HubSpot or a comparable CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Competitive base and incentive package, benchmarked to Director-level sales leadership roles in the European technology/industrial sector. Final compensation band to be confirmed following market benchmarking. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

