&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW67067962 BCX8&quot;&gt;You will be working with some of the industry’s leading Consumer Products Brands, from the large established players to the rapidly growing industry disruptors. We provide advisory services to our clients across the entire value chain from concept to shopping&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW67067962 BCX8&quot;&gt;basket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW67067962 BCX8&quot;&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
