&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience building Kubernetes-native abstractions (CRDs/operators) to manage an agent&#39;s lifecycle declaratively, and/or with durable stateful execution engines (e.g. Temporal) for long-running workflows&lt;/li&gt;
